offset_bottom = 72.0
grow_horizontal = 2
grow_vertical = 2
bbcode_enabled = true
text = "Combat runs on your deck. Costs sit at the top-left; type and rarity sit along the footer.

[b]Attack[/b]: Deal damage with your current modifiers.
[b]Defense[/b]: Gain block that clears at the start of your next turn.
[b]Skill[/b]: Utility plays that buff, debuff, or set up future turns.
[b]Movement[/b]: Reposition on the grid; some refund or chain with tile bonuses.
[b]Power/Mutation[/b]: Persistent effects that stay active for the encounter.
[b]Summon/Resource[/b]: Deploy allies or harvest tiles for resources.

Energy resets each turn—sequence plays around enemy intents and positioning."
fit_content = true

