offset_top = 320.0
offset_right = 1026.0
offset_bottom = 656.0
bbcode_enabled = true
text = "Objective: Destroy the Obelisk; when it falls the battle ends even if minions remain.

Turn Start: Draw your hand; energy resets; block clears. Riftwalker perk: first movement card each turn refunds its cost, and the first Obelisk hit each turn grants +1 energy.

Turn Flow: Play cards in any order; right-click cancels aiming. End turn to let enemies act.

Board Pressure: Obelisks spawn reinforcements on a timer, and every 3 enemy rounds the outer ring is consumed—anything on those tiles dies.

Tips: Mana Wells grant +1 energy on entry; resource tiles feed relic costs; corrupted tiles are off-limits."
fit_content = true

